# Resolved profile catalogs: generated, not committed.
# Regenerate after changing a profile or the catalog extract:
#   poetry run trestle author profile-resolve -n sc28-moderate -o sc28-moderate-resolved
#   poetry run trestle author profile-resolve -n sc28-org -o sc28-org-resolved
# trestle gives them a new random uuid on every run, and nothing in the steel
# thread reads them (component definitions and the SSP point at the profiles).
catalogs/sc28-moderate-resolved/
catalogs/sc28-org-resolved/

